  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "We don't know whether a player uses his own avatar or pedestal avatar. Therefore, we can't praise his avatar easily. \n\nA\"Hey, your avatar looks very nice. Where can I get it?\"\nB\"Well, this is my own avatar.\"\n\nA\"Hey, your avatar is so cute. How did you make this?\" \nC\"I just borrowed this avatar from avatar world.\"\n\nThis problem causes not only miscommunication but also decline of creativity. If there is an indication of \"using avatar from pedestal\", this problem will be solved.",
